<title>INDIA: Cadbury India recommends one-for-five rights issue.</title>
<headline>Cadbury India recommends one-for-five rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Cadbury India on Wednesday announced a rights issue of one equity share for every five shares at a price of 150 rupees.  </p>
<p>A company statement said the rights issue will be subject to approval of market regulator, the Securities &amp; Exchange Board of India and other statutory authorities.</p>
<p>Shares of Cadbury closed at a new 52-week high of 352.0 rupees at the Bombay Stock Exchange on Wednesday, up 18.0 rupees over the previous day's close.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
